  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2202301",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Tang Wen",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220230101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220230101": {
            "id": "220230101",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Ahh, it would be nice to have some Liyue cuisine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230102"
            ]
          },
          "220230102": {
            "id": "220230102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you alright?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230103"
            ]
          },
          "220230103": {
            "id": "220230103",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "You are? With that outfit... You're the Traveler, right? Sorry, I'm just a little homesick...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230118",
              "220230106"
            ]
          },
          "220230118": {
            "id": "220230118",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Huh? Could it be... You know how to make Liyue cuisine? That's great!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230119"
            ]
          },
          "220230119": {
            "id": "220230119",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Th-Then, please help me! Please make me some authentic Liyue dishes!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230120"
            ]
          },
          "220230120": {
            "id": "220230120",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Let me think... What I really want to eat now is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230121"
            ]
          },
          "220230121": {
            "id": "220230121",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Mmm! I want to eat meat! A lot, a lot of meat!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230122"
            ]
          },
          "220230122": {
            "id": "220230122",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "The delicate texture and the fragrant aroma of the meat mixed with Liyue's special spices...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230123"
            ]
          },
          "220230123": {
            "id": "220230123",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Just thinking about it makes me salivate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230124"
            ]
          },
          "220230124": {
            "id": "220230124",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "So, I want to eat meat! Please help me prepare a Liyue dish made of meat!"
          },
          "220230106": {
            "id": "220230106",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Let me introduce myself. I'm Tang Wen, a historian from Liyue. I was previously doing some field research on the unique customs and folklore of Inazuma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230107"
            ]
          },
          "220230107": {
            "id": "220230107",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "I was about to return to Liyue as I had almost finished collecting information. But because of Inazuma's Sakoku Decree, I ended up being stranded here for a long time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230108"
            ]
          },
          "220230108": {
            "id": "220230108",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Actually, I think this is kind of a good thing for me. It's because I feel that this is a historic moment for Inazuma!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230109"
            ]
          },
          "220230109": {
            "id": "220230109",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "I am quite sure that this particular period will certainly leave a strong mark in the annals of history of Teyvat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230110"
            ]
          },
          "220230110": {
            "id": "220230110",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "To witness such history with one's own eyes, and then record all of it in a true, complete and clear manner for posterity, is what a historian should do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230111"
            ]
          },
          "220230111": {
            "id": "220230111",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "But... as exciting as this cause is to me, it won't satisfy my stomach...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230112"
            ]
          },
          "220230112": {
            "id": "220230112",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you getting hungry?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230113"
            ]
          },
          "220230113": {
            "id": "220230113",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "I can't say... it's because I'm hungry... Hahaha, Inazuma's food is quite tasty too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230114"
            ]
          },
          "220230114": {
            "id": "220230114",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "I really like the tempura here, although it feels like everything is coated with batter and then fried...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230115"
            ]
          },
          "220230115": {
            "id": "220230115",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "But after eating Inazuma cuisine for a long time, I started to miss the Liyue dishes. Sadly, I couldn't find a restaurant that could make authentic Liyue cuisine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230116"
            ]
          },
          "220230116": {
            "id": "220230116",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "I finally decided to post a Cuisine Commission at the Adventurers' Guild a few days ago but there hasn't been any response...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230117"
            ]
          },
          "220230117": {
            "id": "220230117",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Can I give it a try?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202307",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220230801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220230801": {
            "id": "220230801",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, which dish should we prepare that is cooked with meat? How about we choose one for her?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230802"
            ]
          },
          "220230802": {
            "id": "220230802",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's see... Paimon's favorite meat dishes lately are...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230803"
            ]
          },
          "220230803": {
            "id": "220230803",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Liyue's famous Mora Meat!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230804"
            ]
          },
          "220230804": {
            "id": "220230804",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Salty and slightly spicy Cured Pork Dry Hotpot!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230805"
            ]
          },
          "220230805": {
            "id": "220230805",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And Goulash made with unique Chilled Meat!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230806"
            ]
          },
          "220230806": {
            "id": "220230806",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Aren't these all your favorite food?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230807"
            ]
          },
          "220230807": {
            "id": "220230807",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, just trust in Paimon's taste! Hurry and choose one~",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230809",
              "220230811",
              "220230813",
              "220230815"
            ]
          },
          "220230809": {
            "id": "220230809",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sounds great! Let's quickly make Mora Meat for Miss Tang Wen!"
          },
          "220230811": {
            "id": "220230811",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yay! Let's quickly make Cured Pork Dry Hotpot for Miss Tang Wen!"
          },
          "220230813": {
            "id": "220230813",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Nice! Let's quickly make Goulash for Miss Tang Wen!"
          },
          "220230815": {
            "id": "220230815",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, let's make the dish for Miss Tang Wen after deciding!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202302",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the completed dish back to Tang Wen",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220230201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220230201": {
            "id": "220230201",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Back so soon? You're not a secret chef, are you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230202"
            ]
          },
          "220230202": {
            "id": "220230202",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Hmmm... I can't wait, please let me try it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230205"
            ]
          },
          "220230205": {
            "id": "220230205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh right... Mora Meat, Cured Pork Dry Hotpot, and Goulash!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230206"
            ]
          },
          "220230206": {
            "id": "220230206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's decide and give it to Miss Tang Wen!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202303",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the completed dish back to Tang Wen",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220230301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220230301": {
            "id": "220230301",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Ah! This is it! This, this is the taste of home I've been dreaming of... It's... *sob* I'm so touched...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230302"
            ]
          },
          "220230302": {
            "id": "220230302",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Thank you so much! I feel energized with all this good food.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230303"
            ]
          },
          "220230303": {
            "id": "220230303",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "These are for you. I wish you a smooth journey ahead!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202304",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the completed dish back to Tang Wen",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220230501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220230501": {
            "id": "220230501",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Hmm, this taste... well, it doesn't seem to taste like a Liyue or Inazuma dish. The taste is really new to me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230502"
            ]
          },
          "220230502": {
            "id": "220230502",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Although it isn't the cuisine I wanted to eat, I'm already satisfied to be able to taste such a novel dish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230503"
            ]
          },
          "220230503": {
            "id": "220230503",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Thank you, Traveler. Please accept these."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202305",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the completed dish back to Tang Wen",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220230601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220230601": {
            "id": "220230601",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Eh? I think this is still an Inazuma dish...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230602"
            ]
          },
          "220230602": {
            "id": "220230602",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "I don't think this is the dish I asked for... Well, never mind, this dish is also filling...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230603"
            ]
          },
          "220230603": {
            "id": "220230603",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Thanks anyway, Traveler. Please take these."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202306",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the completed dish back to Tang Wen",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220230701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220230701": {
            "id": "220230701",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Hmm? Why does th—this dish taste... so... so interesting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230702"
            ]
          },
          "220230702": {
            "id": "220230702",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Can't say it's interesting... Uhh, I should say...unique, or something...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230703"
            ]
          },
          "220230703": {
            "id": "220230703",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "How did you come up with such a dish? Your cooking skills are really...out of this world...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230704"
            ]
          },
          "220230704": {
            "id": "220230704",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Thanks for your hard work! Traveler, please take these. I'll umm, savor this dish later..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202304",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220230401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220230401": {
            "id": "220230401",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Ahh, it would be nice to have some Liyue cuisine about now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230402"
            ]
          },
          "220230402": {
            "id": "220230402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230403"
            ]
          },
          "220230403": {
            "id": "220230403",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Huh, that outfit... You're the Traveler, aren't you? I'm sorry, I'm just feeling a little homesick right now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230418",
              "220230406"
            ]
          },
          "220230418": {
            "id": "220230418",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Huh? Wait... You know how to make Liyue cuisine? That's great!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230419"
            ]
          },
          "220230419": {
            "id": "220230419",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Th—Then, please help me! Please make me some authentic Liyue dishes!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230420"
            ]
          },
          "220230420": {
            "id": "220230420",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Let me think... What I'd really like to eat right now is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230421"
            ]
          },
          "220230421": {
            "id": "220230421",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Mmm! I want to eat meat! Lots and lots of meat!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230422"
            ]
          },
          "220230422": {
            "id": "220230422",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "The delicate texture and the fragrant aroma of the meat mixed with Liyue's special spices...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230423"
            ]
          },
          "220230423": {
            "id": "220230423",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Just thinking about it makes me salivate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230424"
            ]
          },
          "220230424": {
            "id": "220230424",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "So, I want to eat meat! Please help me prepare a Liyue dish made of meat!"
          },
          "220230406": {
            "id": "220230406",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Ah, right. Allow me to me introduce myself. I'm Tang Wen, a historian from Liyue. Previously, I was doing some field research on the unique customs and folklore of Inazuma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230407"
            ]
          },
          "220230407": {
            "id": "220230407",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "I'd finished collecting all the material I needed, in fact, and was preparing to head back to Liyue. But so many big things have happened in Inazuma recently...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230408"
            ]
          },
          "220230408": {
            "id": "220230408",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "So I feel like I'm living in historic times here, you know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230409"
            ]
          },
          "220230409": {
            "id": "220230409",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "The happenings of this particular period will certainly leave a strong mark in the annals of Teyvat's history.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230410"
            ]
          },
          "220230410": {
            "id": "220230410",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "To witness such history with one's own eyes, and then record all of it in a true, complete, and clear manner for posterity — that is what a historian should do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230411"
            ]
          },
          "220230411": {
            "id": "220230411",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "But... as exciting as this cause is to me, it won't satisfy my stomach...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230412"
            ]
          },
          "220230412": {
            "id": "220230412",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hungry, are we?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230413"
            ]
          },
          "220230413": {
            "id": "220230413",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Well, I wouldn't say that exactly... Inazuma's food is actually pretty tasty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230414"
            ]
          },
          "220230414": {
            "id": "220230414",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "I really like the tempura here, although it's, well... They just wrap everything in batter and fry it, you know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230415"
            ]
          },
          "220230415": {
            "id": "220230415",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "But after eating Inazuman cuisine for a long time, I started to miss dishes from back home. Sadly, I couldn't find a restaurant here that could make authentic Liyue cuisine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230416"
            ]
          },
          "220230416": {
            "id": "220230416",
            "speakerId": 3022,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "So I finally decided to post a \"cuisine commission\" at the Adventurers' Guild a few days ago, but there hasn't been any response since...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220230417"
            ]
          },
          "220230417": {
            "id": "220230417",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "May I give it a try?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}